      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1314529169,
      "text": "Ceriops decandra is a mangrove plant of tropical Asia in the family Rhizophoraceae. The specific epithet decandra is from the Greek meaning 'ten male', referring to the flower having ten stamens."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Bido-bido",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bido-bido",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29957775,
      "text": "Ceriops decandra atau bido-bido adalah tanaman bakau Asia tropis dalam keluarga Rhizophoraceae. Julukan khusus decandra berasal dari bahasa Yunani yang berarti \"sepuluh jantan\", mengacu pada bunga yang memiliki sepuluh benang sari."
    }
